                <pb facs="1049" n="935" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg935"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Log, <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg844">p. 844</ref>,
                    records that Roosevelt and Churchill conferred from 11 p.m. until midnight. No
                    record of the discussion has been found. With reference to the meeting at 10
                    p.m. which preceded this conference, in which the Log states that Roosevelt,
                    Hull, and Eden took part, see <hi rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref
                        target="#pg930">p. 930</ref>, fn. 1.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
